msgctxt "page.title"
msgid "sus.bot | robots.txt checker"
msgstr "sus.bot | seiceálaí robots.txt"

msgctxt "page.description"
msgid "Free robots.txt checker. Fetch any site's robots.txt, see which search engines and AI crawlers are allowed or blocked, test paths against the rules, and check how the server responds to each crawler."
msgstr "Seiceálaí robots.txt saor in aisce. Faigh robots.txt suímh ar bith, féach cé na hinnill chuardaigh agus na crawlers AI atá ceadaithe nó blocáilte, tástáil cosáin in aghaidh na rialacha, agus seiceáil conas a fhreagraíonn an freastalaí do gach crawler."

msgctxt "page.skip"
msgid "Skip to content"
msgstr "Léim go dtí an t-ábhar"

msgctxt "page.h1"
msgid "Check and understand your robots.txt before traffic drops"
msgstr "Seiceáil agus tuig do robots.txt sula dtiteann an trácht"

msgctxt "page.themeLabel"
msgid "Colour theme"
msgstr "Téama datha"

msgctxt "ui.theme.toLight"
msgid "Switch to the light theme"
msgstr "Athraigh go dtí an téama sorcha"

msgctxt "ui.theme.toDark"
msgid "Switch to the dark theme"
msgstr "Athraigh go dtí an téama dorcha"

msgctxt "page.langLabel"
msgid "Language"
msgstr "Teanga"

msgctxt "page.intro"
msgid "Enter your domain above. You get a verdict for the business, a fix list that links to the exact lines, and a message you can send straight to IT."
msgstr "Cuir isteach do fhearann thuas. Faigheann tú breith don ghnó, liosta ceartúchán a nascann le gach líne, agus teachtaireacht is féidir a sheoladh díreach chuig an IT."

msgctxt "page.urlLabel"
msgid "Domain, or any address on the site"
msgstr "Fearann, nó seoladh ar bith ar an suíomh"

msgctxt "page.analyse"
msgid "Check robots.txt"
msgstr "Seiceáil robots.txt"

msgctxt "page.urlHint"
msgid "Paste whatever you have: a domain, a page, a link from an email, even the <code>robots.txt</code> address itself. We read <code>/robots.txt</code> from that site and ignore the rest."
msgstr "Greamaigh cibé rud atá agat: fearann, leathanach, nasc as ríomhphost, fiú seoladh an <code>robots.txt</code> féin. Léimid <code>/robots.txt</code> ón suíomh sin agus déanaimid neamhaird den chuid eile."

msgctxt "page.pasteSummary"
msgid "Paste a robots.txt instead"
msgstr "Nó greamaigh robots.txt"

msgctxt "page.pasteLabel"
msgid "robots.txt contents"
msgstr "Ábhar robots.txt"

msgctxt "page.analysePasted"
msgid "Analyse pasted text"
msgstr "Anailísigh an téacs greamaithe"

msgctxt "page.loadExample"
msgid "Load the kitchen-sink example"
msgstr "Lódáil an sampla iomlán"

msgctxt "page.aiStatus"
msgid "AI scraping status"
msgstr "Stádas scrapála IS"

msgctxt "page.agents"
msgid "Crawler access"
msgstr "Rochtain crawlers"

msgctxt "page.agentsIntro"
msgid "Resolved per crawler with RFC 9309 matching: the most specific group wins, then the longest rule, and ties go to <code>Allow</code>."
msgstr "Réitithe in aghaidh an crawler le meaitseáil RFC 9309: buann an grúpa is sainiúla, ansin an riail is faide, agus buann <code>Allow</code> nuair atá siad cothrom."

msgctxt "page.tester"
msgid "Test a path"
msgstr "Tástáil cosán"

msgctxt "page.access"
msgid "Real access by crawler"
msgstr "Fíor-rochtain de réir crawler"

msgctxt "page.accessIntro"
msgid "Request the file again through the proxy, identifying as each crawler in turn. A different status or body means the server treats that crawler differently (bot blocking, WAF rules, cloaking)."
msgstr "Iarr an comhad arís tríd an seachfhreastalaí, in ainm gach crawler ar a sheal. Ciallaíonn stádas nó corp difriúil go gcaitheann an freastalaí leis an crawler sin ar bhealach difriúil (blocáil bots, rialacha WAF, cloaking)."

msgctxt "page.issues"
msgid "Issues"
msgstr "Fadhbanna"

msgctxt "page.security"
msgid "Security notes"
msgstr "Nótaí slándála"

msgctxt "page.securityIntro"
msgid "Disallow rules that name sensitive files and folders, which attackers look for first. This checks what the file reveals, not whether the paths exist or are protected."
msgstr "Rialacha Disallow a ainmníonn comhaid agus fillteáin íogaire, a lorgaíonn ionsaitheoirí ar dtús. Seiceálann sé seo cad a nochtann an comhad, ní cé acu atá na cosáin ann nó cosanta."

msgctxt "page.recon"
msgid "Reconnaissance"
msgstr "Taiscéalaíocht"

msgctxt "page.reconIntro"
msgid "What a stranger learns about this site from the file alone: the platform it runs on, cloud buckets, other hostnames, API entry points, data feeds, file types, and notes left in comments. Nothing here is fetched or probed; it is read straight from the text."
msgstr "Cad a fhoghlaimíonn strainséir faoin suíomh seo ón gcomhad amháin: an t-ardán, buicéid néil, óstainmneacha eile, pointí iontrála API, fothaí sonraí, cineálacha comhad, agus nótaí a fágadh i dtráchtanna. Ní fhaightear ná ní thástáiltear aon rud anseo; léitear go díreach ón téacs é."

msgctxt "page.sitemaps"
msgid "Sitemaps"
msgstr "Léarscáileanna suímh"

msgctxt "page.raw"
msgid "File contents"
msgstr "Ábhar an chomhaid"

msgctxt "page.footerRfc"
msgid "Rule matching follows <a href=\"https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc9309\" rel=\"noopener\">RFC 9309</a> and Google's published crawler behaviour."
msgstr "Leanann meaitseáil rialacha <a href=\"https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc9309\" rel=\"noopener\">RFC 9309</a> agus iompar foilsithe crawlers Google."

msgctxt "page.footerBy"
msgid "A free tool by <a href=\"https://sitefig.eu\" rel=\"noopener\">Sitefig</a>."
msgstr "Uirlis saor in aisce ó <a href=\"https://sitefig.eu\" rel=\"noopener\">Sitefig</a>."

msgctxt "page.noscript"
msgid "This tool runs entirely in your browser and needs JavaScript."
msgstr "Ritheann an uirlis seo go hiomlán i do bhrabhsálaí agus tá JavaScript de dhíth uirthi."

msgctxt "enum.level.error"
