msgctxt "recon.generators.note"
msgid "The file was generated. Change it where the tool is configured, not by hand, or the next save overwrites it."
msgstr "Gineadh an comhad. Athraigh é san áit a bhfuil an uirlis cumraithe, ní de láimh, nó scríobhfaidh an chéad sábháil eile thairis."

msgctxt "md.recon.generators"
msgid "Written by {list}. Change the file where that tool is configured; editing it by hand is overwritten on the next save."
msgstr "Scríofa ag {list}. Athraigh an comhad san áit a bhfuil an uirlis sin cumraithe; má chuirtear in eagar de láimh é, scríobhfar thairis ag an gcéad sábháil eile."

