msgstr "An robat"

msgctxt "sales.title"
msgid "Now keep it that way"
msgstr "Coinnigh mar sin anois é"

msgctxt "sales.body"
msgid "A robots.txt changes with a deploy, a plugin upgrade or a theme edit. One line can cut a site out of Google or hand every AI crawler the whole archive. You have the picture for today; these are the three ways to keep it."
msgstr "Athraíonn robots.txt le himscaradh, le huasghrádú breiseáin nó le hathrú ar théama. Is féidir le líne amháin suíomh a ghearradh amach as Google nó an chartlann ar fad a thabhairt do gach crawler AI. Tá pictiúr an lae inniu agat; seo na trí bhealach chun é a choinneáil."

msgctxt "sales.free.title"
msgid "Free account, free forever"
msgstr "Cuntas saor in aisce, saor in aisce go deo"

msgctxt "sales.free.body"
msgid "Watch one domain and get told when its robots.txt changes. No card, no trial that expires, no call with anyone."
msgstr "Coinnigh súil ar fhearann amháin agus cuirfear in iúl duit nuair a athraíonn a robots.txt. Gan chárta, gan tréimhse thrialach a théann in éag, gan glao le duine ar bith."

msgctxt "sales.free.f1"
msgid "One domain, checked every day"
msgstr "Fearann amháin, seiceáilte gach lá"

msgctxt "sales.free.f2"
msgid "An email when the file changes, with what it does to each crawler"
msgstr "Ríomhphost nuair a athraíonn an comhad, agus a éifeacht ar gach crawler ann"

msgctxt "sales.free.f3"
msgid "The full report and its history, kept"
msgstr "An tuarascáil iomlán agus a stair, coinnithe"

msgctxt "sales.free.cta"
msgid "Create a free account"
msgstr "Cruthaigh cuntas saor in aisce"

msgctxt "sales.free.note"
msgid "Email and a password, or Google. Nothing else is asked."
msgstr "Ríomhphost agus pasfhocal, nó Google. Ní iarrtar aon rud eile."

msgctxt "sales.self.title"
msgid "Or do it yourself"
msgstr "Nó déan tú féin é"

msgctxt "sales.self.body"
msgid "The engine is a command, a GitHub Action and a package. Same checks as this page, running on your machine or in your pipeline, failing the build when the file breaks."
msgstr "Is ordú, GitHub Action agus pacáiste é an t-inneall. Na seiceálacha céanna atá ar an leathanach seo, ag rith ar do ríomhaire nó i do phíblíne, agus teipeann an tógáil nuair a bhristear an comhad."

msgctxt "sales.self.claude"
msgid "Claude can run it for you: install the command and ask it to audit a domain, or wire the Action into your repository."
msgstr "Is féidir le Claude é a rith duit: suiteáil an t-ordú agus iarr air fearann a iniúchadh, nó ceangail an Action le do stór."

msgctxt "sales.self.cta"
msgid "Read the command line docs"
msgstr "Léigh doiciméid na líne ordaithe"

msgctxt "sales.watch.title"
msgid "Or have us watch the market"
msgstr "Nó lig dúinne súil a choinneáil ar an margadh"

msgctxt "sales.watch.body"
msgid "Your domains and your competitors', checked as often as every quarter of an hour, with the alert going wherever your team already reads."
msgstr "D'fhearainn féin agus fearainn d'iomaitheoirí, seiceáilte chomh minic le gach ceathrú uaire, agus an foláireamh ag dul cibé áit a léann d'fhoireann cheana."

msgctxt "sales.watch.f1"
msgid "Competitors side by side, per crawler"
msgstr "Iomaitheoirí taobh le taobh, de réir crawler"

msgctxt "sales.watch.f2"
msgid "Slack, Teams, SMS, webhook, on call"
msgstr "Slack, Teams, SMS, webhook, glao-dhualgas"

msgctxt "sales.watch.f3"
msgid "Reports you can send to a client"
msgstr "Tuarascálacha is féidir leat a sheoladh chuig cliant"

msgctxt "sales.watch.cta"
msgid "See what that costs"
msgstr "Féach cé mhéad a chosnaíonn sé sin"

msgctxt "sales.after.errors"
msgid "The errors above are in force now, in the first file a crawler reads. Each one is listed with its fix. What this page cannot show you is the next change, which usually arrives with a deploy."
msgstr "Tá na hearráidí thuas i bhfeidhm anois, sa chéad chomhad a léann crawler. Tá gach ceann liostaithe lena réiteach. An rud nach féidir leis an leathanach seo a thaispeáint duit ná an chéad athrú eile, a thagann de ghnáth le himscaradh."

msgctxt "sales.after.training"
msgid "Every AI crawler above is allowed to read this site. If nobody decided that, nobody will notice when it changes."
msgstr "Tá cead ag gach crawler AI thuas an suíomh seo a léamh. Mura ndearna aon duine an cinneadh sin, ní thabharfaidh aon duine faoi deara é nuair a athróidh sé."

msgctxt "sales.after.warnings"
msgid "Nothing here is broken today, but the warnings above are how it starts. A robots.txt gets worse one line at a time, and nobody reads it between deploys."
msgstr "Níl aon rud briste anseo inniu, ach is leis na rabhaidh thuas a thosaíonn sé. Téann robots.txt in olcas líne ar líne, agus ní léann aon duine é idir imscaraidh."

msgctxt "sales.after.clean"
msgid "This file is in good order today. The next deploy, plugin upgrade or theme edit is the one to worry about, and watching it is what that takes."
msgstr "Tá an comhad seo in ord maith inniu. Is é an chéad imscaradh, uasghrádú breiseáin nó athrú téama eile an ceann ar cheart a bheith buartha faoi, agus is é súil a choinneáil air atá de dhíth chuige sin."

